<h3 id="-用-max-函式來找出最大值">用 max 函式來找出最大值<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e7%94%a8-max-%e5%87%bd%e5%bc%8f%e4%be%86%e6%89%be%e5%87%ba%e6%9c%80%e5%a4%a7%e5%80%bc" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">SELECT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>users.name,<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">       </span>user_logs.log,<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">       </span>user_logs.updated_at<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">FROM</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>users<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">LEFT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">JOIN</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>user_logs<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">ON</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>users<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>.<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>id<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>user_logs<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>.<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>user_id<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span><span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">AND</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>user_logs<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>.<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>updated_at<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">  </span>(<span style="color:#ff7b72">SELECT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">max</span>(updated_at)<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">   </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">FROM</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>user_logs<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">   </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">WHERE</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>user_logs.user_id<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>users.id)<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">ORDER</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">BY</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>users.id<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/3f4ad3b36da6c68921c002d04cf89734" rel="noopener">last_record_method2.sql</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202201/sql-left-join-last-record/images/sql-left-join-last-record-03.webp" width="1400" height="808" alt="使用SQL fiddle 線上編譯的結果" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>使用<a href="http://sqlfiddle.com/">SQL fiddle</a> 線上編譯的結果</figcaption>
</figure>

<blockquote>
<p><strong>特別提醒</strong>：上述方案在同個 user 的 user_logs 有[年月日時分秒]完全相同的「updated_at」時，會跳出複數筆資料；但此情境在正常環境中不會發生，若想避免此狀況，可以使用 distinct 函式來將 user 過濾。</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2 id="四撰寫找出-right-table最後-updated_at的-sql">四、撰寫找出 right table「最後 updated_at」的 SQL<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e5%9b%9b%e6%92%b0%e5%af%ab%e6%89%be%e5%87%ba-right-table%e6%9c%80%e5%be%8c-updated_at%e7%9a%84-sql" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>有時我們只是要找出使用者最後更新的日期（updated_at），就不必大費周章抓出所有欄位，下面也提供兩個方案。</p>
<h3 id="-用-group-by-的概念搭配-max-函式篩選出最大值">用 GROUP BY 的概念搭配 MAX 函式篩選出最大值<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e7%94%a8-group-by-%e7%9a%84%e6%a6%82%e5%bf%b5%e6%90%ad%e9%85%8d-max-%e5%87%bd%e5%bc%8f%e7%af%a9%e9%81%b8%e5%87%ba%e6%9c%80%e5%a4%a7%e5%80%bc" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">SELECT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>name,<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">       </span>updated_at<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">FROM</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>users<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span><span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">LEFT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">JOIN</span><span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">  </span>(<span style="color:#ff7b72">SELECT</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>user_id,<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">          </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">MAX</span>(updated_at)<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">AS</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span>updated_at<span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">   </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">FROM</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>user_logs<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span><span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#6e7681">   </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">GROUP</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">BY</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>user_id<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>)<span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">AS</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>user_logs<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72">ON</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>users<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>.<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>id<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span><span style="color:#6e7681"> </span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>user_logs<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>.<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span>user_id<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">`</span><span style="color:#6e7681">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/b18a73be311b276ea0f104258c88d573" rel="noopener">last_record_method3.sql</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202201/sql-left-join-last-record/images/sql-left-join-last-record-04.webp" width="1400" height="808" alt="使用SQL fiddle 線上編譯的結果" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>使用<a href="http://sqlfiddle.com/">SQL fiddle</a> 線上編譯的結果</figcaption>
</figure>

<h3 id="-用-laravel-現成函式-subquery-joins-找出最大值">用 Laravel 現成函式 <a href="https://laravel.com/docs/8.x/queries#subquery-joins">subquery-joins</a> 找出最大值<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e7%94%a8-laravel-%e7%8f%be%e6%88%90%e5%87%bd%e5%bc%8f-subquery-joins-%e6%89%be%e5%87%ba%e6%9c%80%e5%a4%a7%e5%80%bc" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-php" data-lang="php"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$latestLogs</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> DB<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">::</span>table(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;user_logs&#39;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>                <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">-&gt;</span>select(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;user_id&#39;</span>, DB<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">::</span>raw(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;MAX(updated_at) as last_log_created_at&#39;</span>))
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>                <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">-&gt;</span>groupBy(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;user_id&#39;</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$users</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> DB<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">::</span>table(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;users&#39;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">-&gt;</span>joinSub(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$latestLogs</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;latest_logs&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#ff7b72">function</span> (<span style="color:#79c0ff">$join</span>) {
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>            <span style="color:#79c0ff">$join</span><span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">-&gt;</span>on(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;users.id&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;=&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">&#39;latest_logs.user_id&#39;</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        })<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">-&gt;</span>get();
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/c3f98ae4141dd457ae25e9c2feeaf0d3" rel="noopener">last_record_method4.php</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
